<title>USA: Gray Communications stake raised by Gabelli.</title>
<headline>Gray Communications stake raised by Gabelli.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investment manager Mario Gabelli said Wednesday it raised its stake in Gray Communications Systems Inc to 486,600 common or 13.90 percent from 12.85 percent previously held.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include the purchase of 36,600 additional common shares between Nov 25 and 6 at $15.8750 to $16.30 per share.</p>
<p>Gray Communications operates two NBC affiliated television stations.</p>
</text>
